# ============================================================================
# Suppressions for the Trivy scans in .github/workflows (config + image).
#
# One identifier per line. Empty lines and `#` comments are ignored, so nothing
# below disables anything — every suppression must be written here deliberately,
# with the reason and the review date, so it can be audited later.
#
# Example (do not uncomment blindly — a suppression with no expiry is a
# vulnerability that has been renamed "accepted"):
#   CVE-2024-00000  # no upstream fix; not reachable, nginx runs read-only. Recheck 2026-12
# ============================================================================
